{"id":"big-lentil","name":{"en":"Big Lentil","ja":"オオオニレンズ豆","sc":"大鬼镜豆","tc":"大鬼鏡豆"},"desc":{"en":"Black beans 3 to 4 times the size of normal lentils. While edible, they aren't very popular due to their dull and unappetizing appearance. They're also quite hard, and painful when thrown.","ja":"レンズ豆の三倍から四倍の大きさを誇る黒い豆。食用にも使えるが、その無味乾燥な見た目のためにあまり流通はしない。ぶつけるとそれなりに痛い"},"level":8,"slots":3,"evalue":20,"earth":true,"effect":70,"kind":"Material","locations":[{"id":"geofront","name":{"en":"Geofront","ja":"ジオフロント"},"parent":"baskes-region"},{"id":"heaven-s-vine","name":{"en":"Heaven's Vine","ja":"天上カズラ"},"parent":"eastern-continent"},{"id":"altar-of-spirits","name":{"en":"Altar of Spirits","ja":"精霊の祭壇"},"parent":"unexplored-lands"}],"categories":[{"id":"grain","name":{"en":"(Grain)","ja":"（穀類）"},"icon":"category-grain"},{"id":"oil","name":{"en":"(Oil)","ja":"（油）"},"icon":"category-fuel"},{"id":"plant","name":{"en":"(Plant)","ja":"（植物類）"},"icon":"category-plant"}],"index":13,"enum":"ITEM_MAT_BIG_LENTIL"}